      </figure>
    </article>

    <article class="news-item">
      <p class="news-item__date"><strong>March 2026</strong></p>
      <h2 class="news-item__title"><strong>Research Presentation in Glasgow</strong></h2>
      <p class="news-text">
        On 4 March, our PI Dr Yixian Sun was invited to give a talk at the Political
        Economy Future Forum Seminar at the University of Glasgow. He presented a paper
        introducing our <a href="/cgel-database/"
          >China&#39;s Global Environmental Leadership (CGEL) Database</a
        > and highlighted key findings on China&#39;s rising leadership in global
        environmental governance. Researchers from different disciplines at the
        University attended the workshop and provided insightful feedback on our
        research. We are grateful for the invitation of Prof Bernhard Reinsberg and look
        forward to deepening our collaboration with Glasgow.
      </p>
      <figure class="news-figure">
        <img
          src="/images/remote/assets-zyrosite-com/yixian-glasgow-26-balvqdj4qm0y52od-c34b0d38b0.jpg"
          alt=""
